So please take a look.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.040
Maybe you remember the spam filtering problem.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:12.480
If you have labeled data, you know, labeled as spam or non-spam email, you can treat

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.680
this as a supervised learning problem.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.960
The second example, the news story example, that's exactly the Google news and tandem

